<title>PORTUGAL: Escudo ends calm, focus on Fed.</title>
<headline>Escudo ends calm, focus on Fed.</headline>
<text>
<p>1655 GMT - The escudo ended calm as investors focused on the FOMC meeting. Dealers said they expected the escudo to remain in a tight range between 100.90 and 101.00 per mark. The escudo closed at 100.97/99 per mark, compared with 100.87/89 at the opening.</p>
</text>
